    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/e6ef3b60b24e3a8ec46e97168112c46f.poster.avif?t=1752505769\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/e6ef3b60b24e3a8ec46e97168112c46f.webm?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/e6ef3b60b24e3a8ec46e97168112c46f.mp4?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math Climber</strong> is not for the faint of heart, but master it's controls and you'll be rewarded with the greatest treasure of all. The treasure of <i>LEARNING</i>.<br><br>Think you\u2019ve got the reflexes of a ninja <i>AND</i> the math skills of a calculator on overdrive?! <strong>Math Climber</strong> cranks up the chaos, throwing you into a mind-melting adventure where every jump counts and every equation could be your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is everything. Miss a platform? Say hello to the abyss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/b24c4f3b1e0e02909ae530deb39eaf96.poster.avif?t=1752505769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/b24c4f3b1e0e02909ae530deb39eaf96.webm?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/b24c4f3b1e0e02909ae530deb39eaf96.mp4?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/a61594a621937feba68b3e821e0a151c.poster.avif?t=1752505769\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/a61594a621937feba68b3e821e0a151c.webm?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/a61594a621937feba68b3e821e0a151c.mp4?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher you go, the wilder it gets. Are you a genius jumper or a math-mangling mess?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One second too slow, one wrong answer, and <strong>BOOM!</strong> Back to the bottom you go! Think you can handle the climb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/475f589c50a5e4d3f108ba154132a385.poster.avif?t=1752505769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/475f589c50a5e4d3f108ba154132a385.webm?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/475f589c50a5e4d3f108ba154132a385.mp4?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/9a9b39f0d86e496cb76c1d5f7d3d44d8.avif?t=1752505769\" width=460 height=330 /></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/e6ef3b60b24e3a8ec46e97168112c46f.poster.avif?t=1752505769\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/e6ef3b60b24e3a8ec46e97168112c46f.webm?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/e6ef3b60b24e3a8ec46e97168112c46f.mp4?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math Climber</strong> is not for the faint of heart, but master it's controls and you'll be rewarded with the greatest treasure of all. The treasure of <i>LEARNING</i>.<br><br>Think you\u2019ve got the reflexes of a ninja <i>AND</i> the math skills of a calculator on overdrive?! <strong>Math Climber</strong> cranks up the chaos, throwing you into a mind-melting adventure where every jump counts and every equation could be your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is everything. Miss a platform? Say hello to the abyss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/b24c4f3b1e0e02909ae530deb39eaf96.poster.avif?t=1752505769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/b24c4f3b1e0e02909ae530deb39eaf96.webm?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/b24c4f3b1e0e02909ae530deb39eaf96.mp4?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/a61594a621937feba68b3e821e0a151c.poster.avif?t=1752505769\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/a61594a621937feba68b3e821e0a151c.webm?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/a61594a621937feba68b3e821e0a151c.mp4?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher you go, the wilder it gets. Are you a genius jumper or a math-mangling mess?! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One second too slow, one wrong answer, and <strong>BOOM!</strong> Back to the bottom you go! Think you can handle the climb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/475f589c50a5e4d3f108ba154132a385.poster.avif?t=1752505769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/475f589c50a5e4d3f108ba154132a385.webm?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/475f589c50a5e4d3f108ba154132a385.mp4?t=1752505769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561510/extras/9a9b39f0d86e496cb76c1d5f7d3d44d8.avif?t=1752505769\" width=460 height=330 /></span> </p>",
